reated_at":"2020-07-05T10:26:31Z","updated_at":"2020-07-05T10:28:34Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/download/v0.2.1/secretd-windows-4.0-amd64.exe"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/assets/22567435","id":22567435,"node_id":"MDEyOlJlbGVhc2VBc3NldDIyNTY3NDM1","name":"secretnetwork_0.2.1_amd64.deb","label":null,"uploader":{"login":"assafmo","id":22766533,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzY2NTMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22766533?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/assafmo","html_url":"https://github.com/assafmo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/assafmo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/assafmo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/assafmo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/assafmo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/assafmo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/assafmo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/assafmo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/assafmo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/assafmo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/vnd.debian.binary-package","state":"uploaded","size":16654060,"digest":null,"download_count":277,"created_at":"2020-07-05T09:31:56Z","updated_at":"2020-07-05T09:33:06Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/download/v0.2.1/secretnetwork_0.2.1_amd64.deb"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/tarball/v0.2.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/zipball/v0.2.1","body":"## Changelog\r\n\r\nUpgraded Tendermint from v0.33.3 to v0.33.6 (Anti DDoS fixes). See https://github.com/tendermint/tendermint/blob/v0.33.6/CHANGELOG.md#v0336 for more.\r\n\r\n## How to upgrade\r\n\r\n:warning: [Make sure to back up your validator node before you make any changes](https://github.com/enigmampc/SecretNetwork/blob/master/docs/validators-and-full-nodes/backup-a-validator.md).\r\n:warning: Make sure to back up your delegator wallet keys with `secretcli keys export <key-alias>` before you make any changes.\r\n\r\n1.  Tell your node to gracefully shut down:\r\n\r\n    ```bash\r\n    perl -i -pe 's/^halt-time =.*$/halt-time = 1593940000/' ~/.secretd/config/app.toml\r\n    ```\r\n\r\nNote: This tells the node to gracefully shut down if the current time is past Sunday, 05-Jul-20 09:06:40 UTC (which it is, so it's going to shut down now). If you wish you can also manually edit `~/.secretd/config/app.toml` and set `halt-height` to a future block. `halt-time = 1593940000` is chosen here for simplicity.\r\n\r\n2.  Load the new configuration:\r\n\r\n    ```bash\r\n    sudo systemctl restart secret-node\r\n    ```\r\n\r\n3.  Make sure the node isn't running:\r\n\r\n    ```bash\r\n    journalctl -u secret-node -f\r\n    ```\r\n\r\n4.  **Only if systemd keeps restarting it** - Manually stop your node:\r\n\r\n    ```bash\r\n    sudo systemctl stop secret-node\r\n    ```\r\n\r\n5.  Download v0.2.1:\r\n\r\n    ```bash\r\n    wget https://github.com/enigmampc/SecretNetwork/releases/download/v0.2.1/secretnetwork_0.2.1_amd64.deb\r\n    ```\r\n\r\n6.  Install v0.2.1:\r\n\r\n    ```bash\r\n    sudo dpkg -i secretnetwork_0.2.1_amd64.deb\r\n    ```\r\n\r\n7.  Tell your node to stop shutting down:\r\n\r\n    ```bash\r\n    perl -i -pe 's/^halt-time =.*$/halt-time = 0/' ~/.secretd/config/app.toml\r\n    ```\r\n\r\n8.  Start your node with the new version:\r\n\r\n    ```bash\r\n    sudo systemctl start secret-node\r\n    ```\r\n\r\n9.  Make sure your node is running properly:\r\n\r\n    ```bash\r\n    journalctl -u secret-node -f\r\n    ```\r\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/28170194","assets_url":"https://api.github.