e":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":504,"digest":null,"download_count":16,"created_at":"2020-04-11T19:52:48Z","updated_at":"2020-04-11T19:52:49Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/download/v0.0.3/SHA256SUMS"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/tarball/v0.0.3","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/zipball/v0.0.3","body":"## Changelog\r\nUpgraded cosmos-sdk from v0.38.1 to v0.38.3 (Anti DDoS fixes). See https://github.com/tendermint/tendermint/blob/v0.33/CHANGELOG.md#v0333 for more.\r\n\r\n## How to upgrade \r\n\r\n:warning: [Make sure to back up your validator node before you make any changes](https://github.com/enigmampc/EnigmaBlockchain/blob/master/docs/validators-and-full-nodes/backup-a-validator.md).\r\n\r\n### From v0.0.1\r\n\r\nFollow [Upgrading a validator or a full node from v0.0.1 to v0.0.2](https://github.com/enigmampc/enigmachain/blob/master/docs/upgrading-v0.0.1-to-v0.0.2.md) but use v0.0.3 instead of v0.0.2.\r\n\r\nOr you can use @dbriggsie's Quicksync, which is a little more dangerous (more downtime) but way faster: https://forum.enigma.co/t/chainofsecrets-org-launches-quicksync/1467/5\r\n\r\n### From v0.0.2\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nsudo systemctl stop enigma-node\r\nsudo dpkg -r enigmachain # might fail but this is okay\r\n\r\nsudo dpkg -i enigma-blockchain_0.0.3_amd64.deb\r\nsudo systemctl enable enigma-node\r\nsudo systemctl start enigma-node\r\n```"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/23961809","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/23961809/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/23961809/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/tag/v0.0.2","id":23961809,"author":{"login":"assafmo","id":22766533,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzY2NTMz","avata